      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "EN 10210-2: r_o = 1.5t, r_i = t. EN 10219-2 (mean of Table A.1): r_o = 2t, 2.5t, 3t for t ≤ 6, ≤ 10, &gt; 10 mm.",
